cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AutoGrey V2, cite the associated research article and the v2.0.0-rc1 software release. Add a repository DOI only after one is actually assigned."
title: "AutoGrey V2: Cross-Task Selection over Governed Grey Forecasting Families"
type: software
version: "2.0.0-rc1"
license: "Apache-2.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Sharafeldin"
    given-names: "Islam Mahmoud"
  - family-names: "Xie"
    given-names: "Naiming"
abstract: >-
  Research software and reproducibility framework for governed cross-task
  selection over heterogeneous grey forecasting-family actions. The protected
  REALBENCH3 primary confirmation criterion failed and that negative result is
  preserved. This candidate is not presented as an externally validated
  performance improvement over AutoGreyR v1.0.0.
keywords:
  - grey systems
  - time-series forecasting
  - algorithm selection
  - meta-learning
  - reproducibility
